    "durationMs": 187654,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and verified. Summary of what I built:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `database/migrations/2026_11_21_000000_create_links_table.php` — `links` table: unique `code` (case-sensitive `utf8mb4_bin` collation), `url` text, `clicks` counter, timestamps\n- `app/Models/Link.php` — Eloquent model with `clicks` cast to integer and a `0` default for new instances\n- `app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php` — store/show/redirect/index; auto-generated 8-char codes from the allowed charset with uniqueness retry; atomic `increment('clicks')` so each redirect counts exactly once\n- `routes/api.php` + `bootstrap/app.php` — routes registered with `apiPrefix: ''` so paths are `/links`, `/links/{code}`, `/r/{code}`; global exception rendering makes every error a JSON `{\"error\": ...}` response (422 validation/malformed JSON, 404 unknown, 409 duplicate)\n- `start.sh` (executable) — `php artisan migrate --force` then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload`, keeping the provided `DB_*` env vars; nothing hard-coded\n- README gained a start-up section and endpoint table\n\n**Verification** — I ran a full curl suite against MySQL through a cold `sh start.sh` start: 201 create (auto + custom code), 409 duplicate, 422 for missing/invalid url, bad codes (short/long/illegal chars), and malformed JSON, 302 redirect with correct `Location`, clicks incrementing 0→1→3 exactly, ascending `{\"items\": [...], \"total\": n}` list, and 404 JSON for unknown codes — plus a restart that preserved all rows and click counts. The starter's test suite passes and Pint reports my files clean. Test data was cleared afterward, so the harness starts with an empty table."
